<title>USA: TENNIS-CHICAGO WOMEN'S RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-CHICAGO WOMEN'S RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-10-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results from the $450,000</p>
<p>Ameritech Cup women's tennis tournament on Monday (prefix</p>
<p>number denotes seeding):</p>
<p>First round</p>
<p>5-Martina Hingis (Switzerland) beat Jolene Watanabe (U.S.)</p>
<p>6-1 6-1</p>
<p>Paola Suarez (Argentina) beat Liezal Horn (South Africa) 6-3</p>
<p>2-6 7-6 (8-6)</p>
<p>Stephanie DeVille (Belgium) beat Laxmi Poruri (U.S.) 6-4 6-7</p>
<p>(8-6) 6-3</p>
<p>Elena Likhovtseva (Russia) beat Zina Garrison Jackson (U.S.)</p>
<p>6-4 6-4</p>
<p>Meredith McGrath (U.S.) beat Patricia Hy-Boulais (Canada) 6-4</p>
<p>6-3</p>
</text>
